## SQ-MG-17 | monkey merge mixins
@group server
@commands Boot; grep latest.log for `GorillaForageBananaMixin`, `SugarGliderForageBananaMixin`, `Mixin apply`, `[creativedelight]`
@pass No mixin apply error; the alexsmobs compartment is on
@fails target changed (Alex's Mobs updated) or the compartment gate is off
@from batches/r1031/a1_boot.qb passed
bootreject (Mixin apply failed|InvalidInjectionException).*(GorillaForageBananaMixin|SugarGliderForageBananaMixin)

## SQ-MG-18 | no chimpanzees in a jungle; gorillas forage Neapolitan bananas
@group server
@commands Fresh world; `/locate biome minecraft:jungle`; `/place feature neapolitan:banana_plant` 20 times around; `/kill @e[type=neapolitan:chimpanzee]` count; then summon 3 gorillas by jungle leaves, `/time add` until they forage
@pass No chimpanzees (kill count 0); gorillas drop and eat Neapolitan bananas, never Alex's Mobs'
@fails chimps: config not read (check the group chance line); Alex's banana: gorilla mixin not applied
@from batches/r1031/b1_gameplay.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> execute positioned 0 70 0 run locate biome minecraft:jungle
waitlog nearest minecraft:jungle is at 300
capture JG is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> tp qa {JG1} 200 {JG3}
sleep 20
repeat 10
> execute at qa run spreadplayers ~ ~ 1 24 false qa
> execute at qa run place feature neapolitan:banana_plant ~ ~ ~
end
> execute at qa run tp qa ~ ~ ~
> kill @e[type=neapolitan:chimpanzee]
> execute at qa run summon alexsmobs:gorilla ~2 ~ ~
> execute at qa run summon alexsmobs:gorilla ~-2 ~ ~
> execute at qa run summon alexsmobs:gorilla ~ ~ ~2
> time add 6000
> cdevtest tickwarp 2400
waitlog verb=tickwarp end=done 240
> execute at qa if entity @e[type=item,nbt={Item:{id:"alexsmobs:banana"}},distance=..48]
> execute at qa if entity @e[type=item,nbt={Item:{id:"neapolitan:banana"}},distance=..48]
expect No entity was found
look the chimp kill finds nothing; the alexsmobs banana check fails and the neapolitan one passes (if neither, gorillas did not forage in the 2400 warped ticks: count leaves near qa, warp longer); spreadplayers moves the bot across the canopy
# `if entity ...nbt` and `place feature` left no log line on 2026-10-31 B1: data get probes instead
> execute at qa run tp qa ~ ~ ~
sleep 1
capture QA Teleported qa to (-?\d+)\.\d+, (-?\d+)\.\d+, (-?\d+)
> cdevtest count {QA1-32} {QA2-40} {QA3-32} {QA1+32} {QA2+20} {QA3+32} neapolitan:banana_stalk
> execute at qa as @e[type=minecraft:item,distance=..48] run data get entity @s Item.id
> execute at qa as @e[type=alexsmobs:gorilla,distance=..48] run data get entity @s HandItems
reject alexsmobs:banana
expect verb=count block=neapolitan:banana_stalk n=[1-9]
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0
look at least one neapolitan:banana among the item ids or hands; banana_stalk count above 0 (checked)
sleep 3

