@group server
@commands Summon 3 sugar gliders by jungle leaves, wait for them to forage; check dropped items with `/data get entity @e[type=item,limit=5,sort=nearest]`
@pass Neapolitan bananas among the drops, no `alexsmobs:banana`
@fails sugar glider mixin not applied
@from batches/r1031/b1_gameplay.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> execute at qa run summon alexsmobs:sugar_glider ~1 ~ ~1
> execute at qa run summon alexsmobs:sugar_glider ~-1 ~ ~1
> execute at qa run summon alexsmobs:sugar_glider ~1 ~ ~-1
> cdevtest tickwarp 2400
waitlog verb=tickwarp end=done 240
